OL,7,Ffrayed after the US struck a
OL,8,Fcontroversial deal to import Russian
OL,9,Fdiesel last week. Ukraine has accused
OL,10,Fthe Trump administration of withdrawing
OL,11,Fkey military support.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
